1
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:08,628
Yantra Workflows comes with three hundred
sixty-five ready-made automations,

2
00:00:08,668 --> 00:00:10,760
grouped by what they do.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,315
Search for the job you need.

4
00:00:12,355 --> 00:00:17,010
This one turns any web page into
clean Markdown and collects its links.

5
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:22,363
Choose Use Template, and Yantra copies
the whole workflow into your project.

6
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:27,812
It opens in the composer with all
fourteen steps already wired together.

7
00:00:28,051 --> 00:00:30,139
The pages to read sit in one place,

8
00:00:30,179 --> 00:00:34,342
and your project's Firecrawl
key is picked up for you.

9
00:00:34,703 --> 00:00:35,523
Press play.

10
00:00:35,563 --> 00:00:40,844
Each step lights up as it runs,
while Firecrawl reads all three pages.

11
00:00:42,791 --> 00:00:46,210
Back comes every title and description,
the page as Markdown,

12
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:48,260
and all of its links.

13
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,600
Start from a template,
and make it yours with Yantra.

